#: ../../develop/gettingstarted.rst:316
msgid "Using ci.sh locally"
msgstr "استخدام ci.sh محليًا"

#: ../../develop/gettingstarted.rst:318
msgid ""
"MicroPython uses GitHub Actions for continuous integration. To reduce "
"dependence on any specific CI system, the actual build steps for Unix-based "
"builds are in the file ``tools/ci.sh``. This can also be used as a script on"
" developer desktops, with caveats:"
msgstr ""
"تستخدم MicroPython آلية GitHub Actions للتكامل المستمر. لتقليل الاعتماد على "
